    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "David Holt built a small log cabin near Main Street in 1860, long before the railroad arrived in 1883.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://holtenterprisenews.com/history/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Around 1850, a stagecoach line between Milton, Fla., and Geneva, Ala., stopped in what is now downtown Holt.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://holtenterprisenews.com/history/",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1900, a 12‑inch well was drilled up on the hill, providing Holt’s residents with reliable water.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://holtenterprisenews.com/history/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Holt’s early economy hinged on timber, with Mart’s Mill and later Smith & Sons Timber Company supplying lumber to the region.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://holtenterprisenews.com/history/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "After the timber boom faded, farmers planted pecan groves, blueberry orchards, and tung trees, though freezes later wiped out satsumas.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28,
        29,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://holtenterprisenews.com/history/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Holt briefly incorporated in 1913 but chose to remain unincorporated the next year, avoiding city bureaucracy.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
